---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: projectQuestions.sections
  size: 1
  alias: section
permalink: "/project/{{ section.number }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ section.title }}"
---
<div class="container">
<div class="card-body">

  <p><a href="/project/">&larr; AI/ML Projects</a></p>

  <div class="alert alert-warning">
    <p class="mb-2"><b>Causal Wizard is designed to help people apply Causal Machine Learning to real world problems</b></p>
    <p>
      These articles about <b>AI and ML project design</b> are intended to
      address the real difficulties people experience when trying to
      define and scope their projects.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1877050921022134" target="_blank">Project design issues are widely regarded as a key cause of project failure</a>.
      So to have the best chance of success, read our tips before you
      start, and review them regularly during your project.
    </p>
    <p>
      These articles are organised as a set of questions you should ask
      yourself about each aspect of your project. <b>Most importantly,
      you do not need to be an AI or ML expert to answer the questions.</b>
    </p>
    <p class="mb-0">
      We also provide a free tool &mdash; a kind of
      <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Business_Model_Canvas" target="_blank">Business Model Canvas</a>
      for AI and ML projects:
      <a class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" href="/project/builder/">Project designer</a>
      Using the tool, you can record your answers to these questions.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="btn-toolbar mb-4 gap-2 flex-wrap" role="toolbar">
    {% for s in projectQuestions.sections %}
      <a class="btn btn-sm {{ 'btn-primary' if s.number == section.number else 'btn-outline-secondary' }}" href="/project/{{ s.number }}/">{{ s.navLabel }}</a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <h2>{{ section.title }}</h2>
  <p class="text-muted">{{ section.subtitle }}</p>

  {% for q in section.questions %}
    <hr class="my-4" />
    <h5>Q{{ section.number }}.{{ loop.index }} {{ q.objective }}</h5>
    <div>{{ q.prompt | safe }}</div>
    {% if q.moreInfo %}
      <h6 class="cw-faint mt-3">Additional context &amp; tips</h6>
      <div>{{ q.moreInfo | safe }}</div>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}

</div>
</div>
